# This repository is byte-verified. Each run's manifest.json and freeze.json,
# and results/stage3/delivery.json, store sha256 hashes of files exactly as
# they exist on disk, and scripts/audit_stage*.py recompute them on checkout.
#
# Any end-of-line conversion changes those bytes and makes every audit fail on
# a fresh clone, so line-ending normalization is disabled repository-wide.
# Do not add 'text=auto' here.
* -text

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.safetensors binary

# SVG figures are text, but should not be diffed line by line in review.
*.svg -diff
